B.akB=new A.n4("How do I update my business profile?","Go to Settings \u2192 Edit Profile. You can update your business name, address, subdomain, and business type. Tap Save after making changes.")
B.akF=new A.n4("How do I change my password?","Navigate to Settings \u2192 Change Password. Enter your current password, then set a new password of at least 6 characters.")
B.akv=new A.n4("How do I manage my service providers?","In the dashboard, navigate to the Providers section. You can invite, view, and manage all service providers assigned to your business.")
B.aky=new A.n4("Can I customize my subdomain?","Yes! Go to Settings \u2192 Edit Profile \u2192 Business Info. Update the subdomain field and save. Note that subdomains must be unique and may take a few minutes to propagate.")
B.akx=new A.n4("How do I view customer bookings?","Visit the Bookings tab in your dashboard. You can filter by date, provider, or status to find specific bookings.")
B.akG=new A.n4("What happens if I forget my password?",'On the login screen, tap "Forgot Password" and enter your registered email. You will receive a reset link within a few minutes.')
B.akO=new A.n4("How is my data protected?","All your data is encrypted in transit (TLS) and at rest (AES-256). We never sell your personal data to third parties. Read our Privacy Policy for full details.")
